Same test thread (06 Nov 14:07): the final answer posted via chat.postMessage contains literal '**complete, evidence-based summary of all testing**', which Slack renders with stray asterisks. Final text sent as a plain message must be converted to Slack mrkdwn (or sent as markdown_text / a markdown block). Check the I065 final-delivery path and any converter it bypasses.

Decision 2026-11-07: share the B849 final-reply lane, after coherent stream/final ownership is established; apply the existing Markdown-to-Slack conversion exactly once at plain-text final delivery, preserving code/link handling and canvas Markdown. B850 is a disjoint lane.